	(gr_text_box "PINs BREAKOUT\n\nNAND\n8 DATA + 6 CTRL\n\nDDR3:\nDATALANE 8 + 3 = 11 x 2\n\nACC: 16 +3 +2 +1 +1 = 23\nA[15:0]\nBA[2:0]\nRAS/CAS\nCS0 WE\n\nCLK: 3\nCK CK# CKE\n\nVREF + CAL + RESET = 3\n\n\nSDMMC\nCMD CK CD DATA[7:0]\nRESET WP 1V8SEL\nTotal: 13\n\n\n============\nPOWER Track widths:\n0.5mm/100mm long gives 5C rise carrying 1A\n6.16mil/100mm gives 1C rise carrying 226mA\n============\nTODO\n3 CLK pins\nConnect 3.3v\nLength match\nemmc and SD (and wifi)\n\n"
